		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat060060"},
		line=1277,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"I accompany Himi-no-Mikoto as we wander through the Imperial Palace of old.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"This is supposedly a transient world created by magicks, but mine eyes cannot distinguish it from reality.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"It fills me with a mysterious feeling, as though I've been transported back to the past.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“What fond memories.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"A warm radiance spills from Himi-no-Mikoto's eyes as she casts her gaze across the audience chamber.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I always loved the sight of sunbeams spilling in from between these shutters.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Such a dazzlingly pure light, one which never failed to rouse hope in my heart.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"Seated upon her throne, Himi-no-Mikoto always bore the commanding visage of an Empress.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"The way she brooked no dissent as she decreed her will to the nobles of her court─I remember it like it was yesterday.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You were always so regal, so beautiful, whenever you sat on your throne.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I could have watched you like that forever.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I see two thousand years was enough for you become learned in the art of flattery. How delightful!”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I did not intend that as flattery.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You're too kind, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"Showing me a smile that reaches all the way to her eyes, Himi-no-Mikoto turns and beckons me.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Now that my spirits have been suitably livened, shall we take a tour of the city?”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"Miraculously, this transient world is even inhabited by its own townspeople.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“The people are just as I remember.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Ahaha! You should know that I have quite the eye for detail.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Though, can we afford to be taking a stroll at a time like this?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Even if time remains frozen, should we not be considering ways we can defeat Kahaku?”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“This fellow still has no appreciation for the sentimental...”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Granted bodies for the first time in forever, we can surely be forgiven for enjoying a little stroll.”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto chides me, her lips quirked up into a grin.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Come, Mitsurugi. Let's be off.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto begins pulling me by the arm.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“No need to seize mine arm. I'm not going anywhere.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“What a crass choice of words. This is nothing more than linking arms.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Oh, I see.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I swear, whatever shall I do with you?”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Aha, is that a tofu vendor I spot over there?”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, let us go try some.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“R-Right...”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto is acting strangely cheerful.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"Why does she insist on wasting our time idly wandering the streets?",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"The Himi-no-Mikoto I knew would surely be dedicating all of herself towards devising a plan for defeating Kahaku.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Could it be that she already has such a plan in mind?",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Eventually, we arrive at that gentle, verdant hillside.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"The place we've visited countless times before.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Say, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Might you lend me your lap as a headrest, just like old times?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Very well.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"I seat myself on the fresh grass bedighted by petals of Persica.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"As soon as I extend mine legs in front of me, Himi-no-Mikoto lays her head upon mine thighs.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mmmmmmm...”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"She arches her back and lets out a long stretch.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Yes, this is it! This scent of spring.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Ahh, I dreamt of this more than anything else while I slept.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You were sleeping all this time?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Perhaps it'd be more accurate to say that my consciousness was adrift alone at sea.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“An endless, endless sea.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I had an abundance of time to think.”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I thought and thought, until eventually, I ran out of things to think about.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"While I spent the past two thousand years fighting Kahaku, Himi-no-Mikoto spent all that time alone with nothing but her own thoughts.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"I cannot even imagine how much she must have suffered.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi. Won't you grace me with your lips?”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What?”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Even you ought to understand that. Kiss me.”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“A-All right...”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Though I have a strange sense of unease about it, I lean forward and touch mine lips to Himi-no-Mikoto's forehead.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Nnm... Hehee, how ticklish.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Will that do?”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“'Tis all I ever wanted.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"Yet her words are belied by the forlorn smile crossing her lips.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"That smile, too, only lingers for a few short moments before vanishing as if snatched away by the tide.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Taking its place, a countenance filled with a wordless determination.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"I involuntarily think back to the day she told me about the reincarnation ritual.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I did a lot of thinking these past two thousand years.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I arrived at the conclusion that I am someone who has but one purpose: to protect the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“That my only reason for existence is to fulfill this purpose of mine.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Having sacrificed the lives of so many, I have no right to live in accordance to my own feelings.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Is that not what it means to be the Empress?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Indeed it is.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto rubs her cheek against mine lap.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“If yours is to cut down all calamity befalling the Empire, then mine is to protect the eternal peace of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Even the Empress is but a tool that exists to serve the realm.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“But while you may have been born a tool, I chose to become one, discarding all that I am and turning my tears unto petals.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Perhaps someday I will be able to accept that fate as my happiness, and become a true Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto lets out a faint sigh.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What are you talking about?”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto remains silent for several seconds.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“As I am now, I cannot draw out your full power.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I have enough. I was able to match Kahaku blow for blow.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Do you remember what he said?”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“He told you to draw your true blade.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Isn't it about time you drew your true blade?”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Kahaku"},
			{
"“Spellblades can hardly compare to the real deal, no?”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“He was speaking nonsense.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto peers into mine eyes.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"Saying nothing, she merely stares at me.",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"...Could it be?",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“In the war with Ko no Kuni, you wielded a blade of your own creation.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Her words set mine heart pounding with consternation.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"No matter which of mine memories I dig through, I'm unable to recall such a thing.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The reason you have no recollection is precisely because your power is incomplete.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You are mine creator, are you not? Should you not be capable of drawing out mine full power?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The threads of my spell don't seem to be connecting.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“No matter how much of my magicks I use, you are incapable of receiving it.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“The reason being?”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“This...”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto points at mine chest.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“And this.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"And then her own.",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You can feel it, can you not?”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Their souls still remain─within you, and within me.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“They are joining hands and desperately trying to resist being consumed by the two of us.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"I have an idea of what she means.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"It is the sensation I felt earlier, that there still remained a part of mine body not mine own.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Which means that Tokita did not fully yield himself to me.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You mean to say that they are impeding us?”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“We need to be able to unleash our full power if we are to defeat Kahaku.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Do not blame them.”",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I'm sure they are not doing it intentionally.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“But at this rate, we cannot hope to defeat Kahaku.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto lays a hand on mine cheek.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I'm sure you know well the strength of Miyaguni and\nTokita's resolve.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“They were willing to cast aside their very selves to defeat Kahaku.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Perhaps it was the only choice to be made for the heir to the throne and her loyal vassal, but I still think them noble and virtuous for having made it.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“...I agree.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"I believe I understand Tokita's feelings.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"He made the warrior's choice to resign himself to his lord's will.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Even to the very end, he never gave voice to the emotions deep within his heart, as to not tarnish the splendid resolve of his lord.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Even so, whether due to the nobility of their spirits, or the strength of their mutual love─",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Their souls continue to live on within me and Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"If I were in his position...",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Tokita must surely be ashamed of himself.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“He accepted his own fate, yet failed to perish.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I imagine Miyaguni feels the same way.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“She could never have wished to be the reason I cannot evoke my full power.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hence, we ought not to blame them.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You're right. I spoke thoughtlessly.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Seeing me lower mine head in contrition, Himi-no-Mikoto smiles at me.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“If I am to honor their sacrifice, I must likewise cast aside my own feelings for the sake of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Mitsurugi, 'tis finally time for you to fulfill the promise you made to me so many years ago.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Mine promise?”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto picks herself up from mine lap.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Brushing aside the peach petals that had fallen upon her body, she stares at me, her eyes swimming with tenderness.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Why does she look at me so?",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"What could she be trying to say?",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Claim my life.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"Unable to form any reply, I simply stare at Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Don't be ridiculous.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“This is no jest.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Why should I have to kill you?”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I shall entrust my legacy with Miyaguni.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“That child should have no issue inheriting my power.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“And what will become of you?”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I shall cease to be.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto's words echo in mine ears, over and over again.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“If Miyaguni is to reclaim this body of mine, yours will surely be overtaken by Tokita as well.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Yes, that is the only way for your power to be unleashed to the fullest.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Unfortunately, that means you would also─”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I don't care what happens to me!”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“But you─you've waited for two thousand years to finally return to this world!”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“At long last... we were able to be reunited...”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto's eyes go wide.",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Heh, heheh...”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Ahahahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"She doubles over in hearty laughter.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“My, how human you've become! I never thought I'd live to see you so emotional!”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“This is no laughing matter!”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"I seize Himi-no-Mikoto's shoulders even as she continues to laugh at me.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Listen to me seriously!”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“You are the one who needs to compose yourself.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Miyaguni and Tokita are the only ones capable of defeating Kahaku.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Can... Can they truly defeat him?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Once you and I cease to be, they will be able to unleash the full extent of our powers.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“With your strength, Tokita will be able to best Kahaku and pin him down.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“And Miyaguni will be able to seize that opportunity to seal him away with magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“That is the only way to defeat a foe who cannot be killed.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“There is no guarantee of success, but there is no other choice to be made.”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto is calm to the very end.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"She would gladly place the peace of the Empire above all else.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Even her own life.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"I know that all too well.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"But what of her feelings?",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"What of her noble heart, which has awaited this day for two thousand long years?",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“But while you may have been born a tool, I chose to become one, discarding all that I am and turning my tears unto petals.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Perhaps someday I will be able to accept that fate as my happiness, and become a true Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"No, she clearly possesses the resolve to cast aside even her own feelings.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"...How can this be?",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"How can it be that ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"a mere tool such",
{"/font"},
" ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"as I",
{"/font"},
" am the only one so shaken by this?",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"The time I spent living as Tokita─the three years I lived without mine memories─it must have changed me more than I ever realized.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“The Empress is a tool that serves the people.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“She needs no human sentiments.”",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“And as the one responsible for giving rise to Kahaku, I have no right to place my own life first.”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"She pauses, biting down on her lip.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Two thousand years ago, I sought to reincarnate myself to serve the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Now, to serve the Empire, I merely need to disappear.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“'Tis nothing to grieve over, is it, Mitsurugi?”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto strokes mine hair as if admonishing her own child.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I understand...”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"I let go of Himi-no-Mikoto's shoulders.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“We have much to learn from Miyaguni and Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Well said.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Let us leave the future to those children.”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“It wouldn't do for the Founding Empress and her faithful servant to disgrace ourselves.”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"Mine lord has spoken.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto slowly stands, holding her hair down as it dances softly on the wind.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Her gentle eyes reflect the Tenkyo vista, drenched in the haze of spring.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Ah, 'tis a good day to set off on this next journey.”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I'm glad I was able to come to this hillside with you one last time.”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You intended to die from the very start?”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I wonder about that...”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“If Tenkyo were not so beautiful, perhaps I might have abandoned everything and instead eloped with you.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I would not mind that.”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Is that so?”",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto, mine one and only love.",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"With these feelings in mine breast, I undertook your request to claim your life on that day two thousand years ago.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"─If your death must come to pass, then please, let it at least be at mine own hand.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"Mine soul yearned to be intimately involved with yours, even in its final, fleeting moments.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"And unto this day, these feelings of mine remain unchanged.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Do the honors, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto presents me the blade at her hip.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"I grasp it with steady hands.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“How shall I do it?”",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Have my head. Lop it clean off.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I trust your bladesmanship will be true?”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Who do you think you're talking to?”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Hahaha, I meant no offense, o savior of the realm.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Giggling facetiously, Himi-no-Mikoto makes her way to the shade of a large peach tree.",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			{
"This is to be her final resting place.",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"Could there be any place of death more fitting for the\nEmpire's first and greatest Empress─she who turned even her own tears unto petals?",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			{
"Alas, how they fall and scatter.",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“For two thousand years, I have lamented mine failure to send you off myself.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Why? Why was I so powerless even to grant the last request of mine lord?”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“My selfishness has caused you much suffering.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Forgive me.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“No! I was─!”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"Mine voice suddenly catches in mine throat.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"An unbearably hot pressure builds up behind mine eyes and nostrils─",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"A sensation I've never experienced before.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“What's this...?”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"A streak of warm liquid drips down mine cheek.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"Am I... crying?",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"Never once have I shed any tears until today.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Are you crying on my account?”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I apologize for this shameful display of sentiment.”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Ahaha, the lord casts aside her tears, yet the tool cannot hold them back.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Still, you've done well in coming to understand human emotions.”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I see you have faithfully remembered my command to you, all these two thousand years.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto smiles at me.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"A contented, untroubled smile, so strikingly lovely as to put the splendor of all the surrounding Persica to shame.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			{
{"font", size=47},
"For this single, fleeting moment, it is not mine Empress who smiles at me, but Himi-no-Mikoto, the kind, sensitive girl whose love for peach blossoms and the Imperial people knows no bounds.",
{"/font"},
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Miyaguni! Tokita!”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“I leave the future of the Empire in your hands!”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Strike Kahaku down and see peace restored to this land!”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"Her dignified voice rings out from the hillside.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"As Himi-no-Mikoto wills, so shall I.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"Hear me, Tokita.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"I leave the rest to you.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"You, too, are one who cuts down all calamity befalling the Empire─",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"You, too, are one who loves his lord more than life itself─",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			{
"So, on mine behalf, rend our foe asunder.",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"Do not permit Kahaku to ever threaten the Empire again.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“It's time, Mitsurugi.”",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Kill me. For the future of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I obey!”",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"I move to stand next to Himi-no-Mikoto.",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"Drawing mine blade, I raise it aloft.",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"The faint glow of Yoizuki's magicks shimmers in the air.",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"Sweat gushes from mine palms.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			{
"Tighter, and tighter still, I grip the hilt of mine blade to prevent mine hands from slipping.",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Be at ease. I won't come back and haunt you.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"She won't come back and haunt me...",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"That makes it the third time I've heard those words.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You have no need to come back. I'll be joining you all too soon.”",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“True enough.”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“If I'm able to be an ordinary woman in my next life, perhaps I'll have you try some of my cooking.”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“You, learning how to cook?”",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“Don't you sell me short, now.”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"A mischievous smile still playing across her lips, Himi-no-Mikoto gently closes her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"The time has come.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"The wind rises, sending a whirlwind of peach petals dancing across the sky.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			{
"Ever so slightly, Himi-no-Mikoto tilts her head forward.",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"The pale, unblemished skin of her neck reflects the dazzling light of the setting sun.",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"Fare thee well─",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			{
"Mine one true love.",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Ooooaaaaaaaaaagh!”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			hide=1,
			{
"They scatter...",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			hide=1,
			{
"Fluttering from the sky.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			hide=1,
			{
"One petal of Persica, and another.",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			hide=1,
			{
"Alas, o beloved, tell me why.",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			hide=1,
			{
"Must you continue your fight, even unto your tears run dry?",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			hide=1,
			{
"Nay, I know all too well the reason.",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			hide=1,
			{
"Yet mine is the sound and fury and sorrowful lamentation that even now, you must bid me farewell without a single tear in your eyes.",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			hide=1,
			{
"And yours, a peerless courage, equal in radiance to the glory of your days.",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto...”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			{
"Mine mind is wholly numb.",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			{
"The strength departs mine hands, and swimming in the haze of spring, mine vision begins to blur.",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
"As mine consciousness fades, the words of mine lord resonate deep within mine ears.",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“(You have done well.)”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Himi-no-Mikoto... I...”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“I love you!”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Though I am but a tool, I love you!”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“(As do I, Mitsurugi.)”",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“(I am a tool known as the Empress, but I love you.)”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			{
"I yearn to scream.",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"I yearn to scream Himi-no-Mikoto's name till the end of mine days.",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			{
"Yet the overwhelming tide of emotions prevents even a single sound from escaping mine throat.",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Himi-no-Mikoto"},
			{
"“(Truly, it gladdens me that you were the one to claim my life.)”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			name={"name", name="Mitsurugi"},
			{
"“Your words... bring me joy.”",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			{
"Himi-no-Mikoto's voice drifts away and vanishes on the wind as an ephemeral dream.",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			{
"I pray that mine words might have reached her.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
